    "Name": "Epona N",
    "Details": "The N configuration of the Epona Hovertank is the second Nova CEWS configuration the Society developed, meant for extended combat. Its main weapon is a Clan ER Large Laser aided by a Clan advanced targeting computer, while the secondary equipment is limited to a TAG and a Clan iATM-6, and its Clan Nova CEWS links it with other Nova units.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 9/14 hexes / 270/420 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Ferro-Fibrous (C)\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       110     25\n<b>Left</b>         105     25\n<b>Right</b>       100     25\n<b>Rear</b>        100     25\n<b>Turret</b>      100     25\n\n<b>Total</b>      515    125</color>\n\n<color=#ffcc00> Omni Vehicle</color>",
